# Requirements

## Scope
A bilingual (Arabic/English) health record platform where patients view their own records and doctors can access only critical information in an emergency. Prototype uses synthetic data only.

## Users
Patient, doctor, hospital administrator.

## User stories
1. As a patient, I want to log in securely so that only I can see my record.
2. As a patient, I want to view my conditions, medications, and allergies so that I understand my health.
3. As a patient, I want to switch between Arabic and English so that I can read it in my language.
4. As a doctor, I want an emergency view showing only critical information so that I can treat an unconscious patient safely.
5. As a patient, I want a plain-language summary of my history so that I can explain it to a new doctor.
6. As a hospital administrator, I want to add a patient's report so that the record stays up to date.
